{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VDeNFhdQLy1793711193.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在北京，外交部宣布，中方考慮各項因素後，決定以視像方式舉辦今年的APEC外交和貿易雙部長會議。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧稱：「作為今年APEC的東道主，中方高度重視舉辦APEC外交和貿易雙部長會議，綜合考慮各方面的因素，從確保效果的角度出發，我們決定以視頻的方式，舉辦今年的APEC雙部長會議。我們相信，在各方共同努力下，此次APEC雙部長會議將取得積極成果，為領導人非正式會議做好充分的準備。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:14.841592+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T23:58:18.381828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:31.022500+00:00","content_hash":"b9baa9c8f9978ca73bcd7c5f8e208dec4ea6eaf5033df7161c17691f8a367a79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:14.841592+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}